{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:0.2"], "en": "Tikanipāta,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:0.3"], "en": "Kumbhavagga", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:0.4", "PA_ja_297:1.1"], "en": "7. The Kāmavilāpa Jātaka “O bird, crying out so loudly,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:1.2"], "en": "you who travel on wings through the air;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:1.3"], "en": "\"You should speak to her, O fair-thighed one;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:1.4", "PA_ja_297:2.1"], "en": "she will take a long time. She does not know this.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:2.2"], "en": "The sword and the spear that have been hurled—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:2.3"], "en": "fierce and wrathful, they strike with anger;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:2.4"], "en": "it is that which burns me, not this.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:3.1"], "en": "This lotus-arrangement,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:3.2"], "en": "with a gold coin placed upon its head,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:3.3"], "en": "and a soft cloth from Kāsī—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:3.4"], "en": "“May my dear creditors be satisfied.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_297:4.1"], "en": "Thus ends the seventh Jātaka, the Kāmavilāpa Jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
